{"unit_id":"QGG4588__dsh-model-failover#card-zh","repo":"QGG4588/dsh-model-failover","commit":"e3264e05397902cb322711fac565d90815ec965f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Model Failover（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：模型请求遇到限流、配额耗尽、超时或其他可配置失败码时，按用户选择的供应商池切换到下一个尚未尝试的模型并重试。插件接入 DSH 的请求和请求错误处理流程，使用 modelCatalog 展开供应商下的模型；候选池耗尽后交还原错误。它还提供熔断冷却和健康模型主动绕行、按会话粘滞目标、model_failover 运行时工具，以及输入框旁的 Web 面板，可管理供应商池、开关和查看状态。适合希望在模型服务临时故障时自动继续请求的 DSH 用户。状态保存在本机 DSH_HOME 下，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:323-459","index.js:501-595","client.js:107-180"]}
{"unit_id":"QGG4588__dsh-model-failover#card-en","repo":"QGG4588/dsh-model-failover","commit":"e3264e05397902cb322711fac565d90815ec965f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Model Failover retries failed requests with the next untried model in a provider pool. It adds circuit cooldowns, optional routing around unhealthy models, a runtime tool, and a Web panel for managing providers and viewing status. State stays under DSH_HOME; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:323-459","index.js:501-595","client.js:107-180"]}
{"unit_id":"QGG4588__dsh-model-failover#feature-pool-retry","repo":"QGG4588/dsh-model-failover","commit":"e3264e05397902cb322711fac565d90815ec965f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Model Failover 的功能「故障转移重试」：请求遇到配置允许的失败码时，从所选供应商池中挑选尚未尝试的模型并重新发送；池耗尽后交还原错误。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:375-459"]}
{"unit_id":"QGG4588__dsh-model-failover#feature-circuit","repo":"QGG4588/dsh-model-failover","commit":"e3264e05397902cb322711fac565d90815ec965f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Model Failover 的功能「熔断和绕行」：模型在失败窗口内达到阈值后进入冷却，同一供应商多个模型熔断时可整组冷却；请求命中冷却模型时可主动改道健康候选。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:225-282","index.js:323-373"]}
{"unit_id":"QGG4588__dsh-model-failover#feature-runtime-tool","repo":"QGG4588/dsh-model-failover","commit":"e3264e05397902cb322711fac565d90815ec965f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Model Failover 的功能「运行时池管理」：调用 model_failover 工具查看状态、设置或清空供应商池，以及启用或停用转移；更改即时写入状态文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:501-595"]}
{"unit_id":"QGG4588__dsh-model-failover#feature-web-panel","repo":"QGG4588/dsh-model-failover","commit":"e3264e05397902cb322711fac565d90815ec965f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Model Failover 的功能「Web 管理面板」：在对话输入区旁选择供应商池、展开查看模型、保存或清空设置并切换启用状态，也能查看模型冷却和最近事件。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:107-180","client.js:223-234","index.js:652-715"]}
{"unit_id":"QGG4588__dsh-model-failover#caveat-local-state","repo":"QGG4588/dsh-model-failover","commit":"e3264e05397902cb322711fac565d90815ec965f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Model Failover 使用前须知：运行时供应商池、会话粘滞目标和状态快照会写入 DSH_HOME 下的 model-failover/state.json；未设置 DSH_HOME 时默认位于用户目录的 .dsh。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:63-88"]}
